<p id="S4.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="S4.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{-q}(G,e)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{-q}(G,e)</annotation></semantics></math> is the feasible vector witnessed by <math id="S4.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(G,e)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(G,e)</annotation></semantics></math> with parameter <math id="S4.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=-q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=-q</annotation></semantics></math>. In what follows, let</p>
